 "strings": [
  "",
  "The fight for Southeast Asia",
  "was now in its final phase.",
  "Driven into a corner, Zeon",
  "awakened the Apsaras,",
  "which had been meant",
  "for the battle of Jaburo.",
  "It was no longer",
  "a military operation;",
  "it was an act of survival.",
  "No.",
  "It does not seem to have been",
  "an act of survival, either.",
  "For friend and foe alike,",
  "everyone had forgotten treaties,",
  "military law, human decency,",
  "even their own survival--",
  "forgotten everything, and begun",
  "to slaughter one another.",
  "The Hospital Ship Kergelen",
  "A Man Named Ginias",
  "The Kergelen",
  "was a Zanzibar-class battleship",
  "serving as a makeshift hospital,",
  "due to escape this battlefield",
  "and return to space.",
  "Norris, too,",
  "had fought only the Guntanks",
  "and died",
  "to open the way",
  "for the Kergelen.",
  "Ginias Sahalin.",
  "Aina's elder brother.",
  "Wealthy-born and frail, and yet,",
  "following the custom of the day,",
  "he had joined the military.",
  "Zeon's elite",
  "all entered the military;",
  "such were the times.",
  "His frailty kept him",
  "from a proper soldier's career,",
  "so he became a technical officer.",
  "What he poured his soul into",
  "building was the Apsaras.",
  "Ginias",
  "\"It's complete...\"",
  "\"My child, the Apsaras.\"",
  "This was the devil overhead.",
  "This, Southeast Asia's last battle.",
  "Aina",
  "\"Attention, Federation forces!",
  " This is the mobile armor.\"",
  "\"I propose a temporary ceasefire.\"",
  "\"You don't mind, do you, Brother?\"",
  "\"Do as you please.\"",
  "\"That last attack was a warning.\"",
  "\"Unless you cross that line,",
  " we will not attack.\"",
  "Shiro",
  "\"Aina... Aina, it's you, isn't it?\"",
  "Karen",
  "\"Lieutenant, what do you mean?\"",
  "\"We are about to evacuate",
  " the base's sick and wounded.\"",
  "\"Please. Just for that long,",
  " hold your fire.\"",
  "\"Ah!\"",
  "Ginias ignored his sister Aina",
  "and attacked with the Apsaras",
  "at almost the same moment",
  "Federation forces attacked",
  "and destroyed the hospital ship.",
  "Besides the Guntanks,",
  "the Federation had other means",
  "of long-range bombardment.",
  "That was the GM Sniper.",
  "Aina's dream of the battlefield",
  "ended as only a dream.",
  "「……」",
  "\"I'm quitting the army.\"",
  "\"Karen,",
  " I'm leaving the rest to you.\"",
  "\"Lieutenant!\"",
  "\"Sorry.\"",
  "\"Tch.",
  " You might be fine",
  " with that, but...!\"",
  "\"Men, every last one of 'em,",
  " they always go off",
  " and leave me behind!\"",
  "\"Shiro Amada...\"",
  "\"You are",
  " the worst soldier",
  " I've ever met!\"",
  "The battle begins.",
  "The fight for Southeast Asia",
  "was over.",
  "Postwar records state",
  "that on this day Shiro Amada,",
  "a second lieutenant, deserted",
  "under fire and was killed in action.",
  "It is said that, during the war",
  "and after, his old men searched",
  "for Shiro on their own,",
  "but that is all.",
  "The military left",
  "no further record.",
  "Of the Federation's 2,400",
  "MS platoon leaders, such was",
  "the end of one.",
  "There are heroes,",
  "and there are those who are not.",
  "There are also people",
  "who fell short of being heroes."
